cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "agda-lattices: lattice theory in Agda"
abstract: >-
  A formalization of lattice theory in Agda, on top of the Agda Universal
  Algebra Library: lattice terms and Whitman's solution of the word problem
  for free lattices, the free lattice and its universal property, canonical
  forms, Whitman's condition and semidistributivity, substitutions, free
  generating sets, embeddings and complexity, Whitman's countable family;
  free generation and breadth in lattices satisfying Whitman's condition;
  bounded homomorphisms, projective lattices and Kostinsky's theorem;
  Nation's theorem for finite lattices; quotients, intervals, modular and
  distributive lattices, central elements and direct decompositions, finite
  products, and lattices given by their operation tables.  Every module is
  checked under --without-K --exact-split --safe.
authors:
  - family-names: "DeMeo"
    given-names: "William"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1832-5690"
